ass="h_link color-inversion-target w-inline-block"><div class="h_txt">LOGIN</div></a><a data-ms-content="!members" href="../../de/en/sign-up" class="h_link color-inversion-target w-inline-block"><div class="h_txt">REGISTER</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section data-w-id="afedfe31-667c-c7b3-0247-375a5e7af9ae" class="hero_article"><div class="wrapper_article"><div class="article_box"><div><div class="tag_category"><div class="dot_dec black"></div><div class="tag_txt">Interesting Activities</div></div></div><div class="article_headline_box"><h1 class="h1_article">Hidden gems: resorts surrounded by breathtaking nature, cuisine, and relaxation</h1></div><div class="date_time"><div><div class="date_article">October 27, 2024</div></div><div class="read_time_box"><div class="read_time">7 min</div><div class="read_time">lesen</div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-w-id="cafe7420-bb79-1c7e-c1a0-8b5be32c0a9b" class="section_parallax"><div class="fullsize_image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/671eaadad707d274800d7d30_16.avif" loading="lazy" alt="Hidden gems: resorts surrounded by breathtaking nature, cuisine, and relaxation" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/671eaadad707d274800d7d30_16-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/671eaadad707d274800d7d30_16.avif 1002w" class="image"/></div></section><section><div class="article_content"><div class="flex_article"><div class="voice_over"><a data-w-id="ddab0ff8-12df-a161-3538-2d6f1915d603" href="../../de/en/blog/hidden-gems-resorts-surrounded-by-breathtaking-nature-cuisine-and-relaxation#" class="voice_box w-inline-block"><div class="voice_first"><div class="voice_icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6713971095c4a7cab5d924ee/671d482bd7c1176b65d3fed6_listen.avif" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="listen_article start">Artikel anhören</div><div class="listen_article stop">Hör auf zu hören</div></div><div class="play_line"><div class="active_bar"></div><div class="passive_bar"></div></div></a></div><div class="content_article"><div class="description_box"><div class="description_first">If you’re seeking a unique vacation experience that offers pure relaxation amidst stunning natural surroundings, these resorts are the perfect hidden gems. Here, luxury, culinary delights, and spectacular nature experiences come together. In this blog post, we’ll introduce you to some secret treasures that you can easily book through CHECK24.</div></div><div class="rich_part_1"><div class="w-richtext"><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690765bd3f2464c805c1ca0f_e5de4b77.jpeg"/></div></figure><h2><strong>1. Kotor, Montenegro – Nature, Mountains, and the Sea Combined</strong></h2><p>Kotor, nestled in a picturesque bay surrounded by mountains, offers the perfect blend of nature and history. This region is an emerging hidden gem for travelers seeking relaxation and unspoiled landscapes.</p><h3><strong>Recommended Resorts</strong></h3><p><strong>HUMA Kotor Bay Hotel &amp; Villas<br/></strong>Luxurious villas with views of the turquoise water, privately and quietly located.</p><p><strong>Hotel Forza Terra<br/></strong>A small boutique hotel right by the water, ideal for romantic getaways.</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Boat tour through the Bay of Kotor.</p><p>Hike in Lovćen National Park.</p><p>Visit the old town of Kotor, a UNESCO World Heritage Site.</p><blockquote><strong>Book your stay in Kotor here</strong>:<a href="https://www.check24.de/"> CHECK24 - Kotor Hotels</a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690765bd3f2464c805c1ca12_7979bb6b.jpeg"/></div></figure><h2><strong>2. Ubud, Bali – Tropical Rainforest and Spiritual Relaxation</strong></h2><p>Ubud is the cultural heart of Bali, surrounded by dense forests and rice fields. Here, you can completely unwind amidst exotic nature and spiritual tranquility.</p><h3><strong>Recommended Resorts</strong></h3><p><strong>The Hanging Gardens of Bali<br/></strong>One of the most spectacular resorts in the world, nestled in the rainforest with an infinity pool overlooking the jungle.</p><p><strong>COMO Uma Ubud<br/></strong>A luxurious wellness resort offering Balinese massages and breathtaking natural scenery.</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Yoga and meditation classes amid the rice fields.</p><p>Visit the Sacred Monkey Forest.</p><p>Cooking classes featuring traditional Balinese cuisine.</p><blockquote><strong>Book your stay in Ubud here:</strong><a href="https://www.check24.de/"><strong> CHECK24 - Ubud Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690765bd3f2464c805c1ca15_dca7638a.jpeg"/></div></figure><h2><strong>3. Amalfi Coast, Italy – Luxurious Relaxation with Panoramic Views</strong></h2><p>The Amalfi Coast is renowned for its dramatic cliffs, picturesque villages, and stunning views of the Mediterranean. Here, luxury meets Italian elegance.</p><h3><strong>Recommended Resorts</strong></h3><p><strong>Le Sirenuse, Positano<br/></strong>A luxurious 5-star hotel with spectacular views of the coast.</p><p><strong>Monastero Santa Rosa Hotel &amp; Spa<br/></strong>A converted monastery that now serves as an exclusive resort with a beautiful infinity pool.</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Boat tour along the coast and visit the island of Capri.</p><p>Hiking along the &quot;Path of the Gods.&quot;</p><p>Enjoying fresh pasta and seafood at one of the traditional restaurants.</p><blockquote><strong>Book your stay on the Amalfi Coast here:</strong><a href="https://www.check24.de/"><strong> CHECK24 - Amalfi Coast Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690765bd3f2464c805c1ca1e_9f12b6a9.jpeg"/></div></figure><h2><strong>4. Azores, Portugal – A Nature Paradise in the Atlantic</strong></h2><p>The Azores are a true natural wonder, consisting of nine volcanic islands. They offer a tranquil, exotic escape for nature lovers, away from the tourist crowds.</p><h3><strong>Recommended Resorts</strong></h3><p><strong>White Exclusive Suites &amp; Villas<br/></strong>Luxurious villas with breathtaking views of the Atlantic, perfect for relaxation.</p><p><strong>Furnas Boutique Hotel Thermal &amp; Spa<br/></strong>A spa resort known for its thermal springs and impressive volcanic landscape.</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Whale watching and dolphin safaris.</p><p>Hiking in the lush crater landscapes.</p><p>Relaxing in natural hot springs.</p><blockquote><strong>Book your stay in the Azores here:</strong><a href="https://www.check24.de/"><strong> CHECK24 - Azores Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690765bd3f2464c805c1ca18_2d20e4e7.jpeg"/></div></figure><h2><strong>5. Krabi, Thailand – Exotic Beaches and Serenity</strong></h2><p>Located on Thailand&#x27;s west coast, Krabi is a paradise for those seeking a peaceful beach vacation. The region features stunning limestone cliffs, crystal-clear waters, and luxurious resorts.</p><h3><strong>Recommended Resorts</strong></h3><p><strong>Rayavadee Resort<br/></strong>A luxurious resort nestled between jungle and beach, accessible only by boat.</p><p><strong>Phulay Bay, A Ritz-Carlton Reserve<br/></strong>An exclusive resort that offers ultimate luxury and relaxation.</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Island hopping to the famous Phi Phi Islands.</p><p>Snorkeling and diving in the crystal-clear waters.</p><p>Visiting the Tiger Cave Temple for spectacular views of the surroundings.</p><blockquote><strong>Book your stay in Krabi here:</strong><a href="https://www.check24.de/"><strong> CHECK24 - Krabi Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690765bd3f2464c805c1ca1b_1616db0b.jpeg"/></div></figure><h2><strong>6. Seychelles – Dream Beaches and Luxurious Seclusion</strong></h2><p>The Seychelles offer some of the most pristine beaches in the world. This paradisiacal archipelago in the Indian Ocean is perfect for those seeking exclusivity and tranquility amid nature.</p><h3><strong>Recommended Resorts</strong></h3><p><strong>Four Seasons Resort Seychelles<br/></strong>Pure luxury with private villas nestled in lush green hills.</p><p><strong>Constance Lemuria<br/></strong>A resort on Praslin with access to the most beautiful beaches in the Seychelles.</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Snorkeling in the coral reefs of the Seychelles.</p><p>Relaxing on iconic beaches like Anse Source d’Argent.</p><p>Boat trips to secluded islands and coves.</p><blockquote><strong>Book your stay in the Seychelles here:</strong><a href="https://www.check24.de/"><strong> CHECK24 - Seychelles Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690729cc6622a7dbabf1d8e4_f0140496.jpeg"/></div></figure><h2><strong>7. Tulum, Mexico – Nature and Culture Combined</strong></h2><p>Tulum is a true hidden gem on the Riviera Maya. The town offers a perfect blend of Caribbean beaches, Mayan ruins, and relaxing eco-resorts.</p><h3><strong>Recommended Resorts</strong></h3><p><strong>Azulik Resort<br/></strong>A luxurious eco-resort with direct access to the jungle and sea, ideal for nature lovers.</p><p><strong>Be Tulum<br/></strong>A stylish beach resort featuring luxurious suites and an impressive spa.</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Visit the Mayan ruins of Tulum.</p><p>Swim in cenotes (underground caves).</p><p>Relax in one of the many eco-spas and yoga retreats.</p><blockquote><strong>Book your stay in Tulum here:</strong><a href="https://www.check24.de/"><strong> CHECK24 - Tulum Hotels</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690765bd3f2464c805c1ca22_8a317748.jpeg"/></div></figure><h2><strong>8. Whistler, Canada – Relaxation and Adventure in the Mountains</strong></h2><p>Whistler, one of the most renowned ski regions in the world, offers breathtaking natural scenery and top-notch resorts for both winter sports enthusiasts and summer vacationers.</p><h3><strong>Recommended Resorts</strong></h3><p><strong>Fairmont Chateau Whistler<br/></strong>A luxurious hotel directly on the ski slopes, perfect for both winter and summer getaways.</p><p><strong>Four Seasons Resort Whistler<br/></strong>An exclusive resort set amidst the stunning Canadian mountain landscape.</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Skiing and snowboarding in winter; hiking and mountain biking in summer.</p><p>Relaxing in the lakes of Whistler.</p><p>Enjoying culinary delights in mountain lodges and restaurants.</p><blockquote><strong>Book your stay in Whistler here:</strong><a href="https://www.check24.de/"><strong> CHECK24 - Whistler 